        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ee59a6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-17T00:51:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a guy in my group who loves Mr Fixer. and never really plays anyone else<br>he raised a question that I thought I would ask here<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Mr Fixer's Style card don't get discard when he plays a new one they just return to his hand<br><br>Why don't his tools do the same thing ?<br>and<br>would it unbalance Mr Fixer as a character if it was added that they did?<br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:23.343Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
