        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-17T01:08:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You have that the wrong way round, tools go back to your hand, styles don't.&nbsp;<span>But I have no idea why.</span></p><p>Would it be unbalancing? Probably not and if it makes your friend happier playing with him do it, just be sure to tell people of any house rules before you start playing (and don't submit any of the games to the stats project, house rules are not encouraged there).</p>",
