        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-17T01:21:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One of the reasons I can think of is that Styles of Meditation which allow you to search for the style you desire in both the deck and trash. Where Tools can't be searched for at all. However you can retrieve all equipment cards with Salvage Yard, at the same time though since tools don't usually get destroyed it isn't too common to retrieve a lot of your equipment cards from the trash</p>",
